SUMMARY:Otzias festival (Agia Marina)\, Otzias
LOCATION:Otzias\, Kea (Tzia)\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The 'Giorti tou Otzia'\, co-organised by the municipality and the local society on 17 July (Agia Marina's day) from 20:00 on the waterfront: food from the village associations\, live island music and dancing by the sea. The bay's tavernas are the fallback for dinner if the queues get long\; it's a 15-minute drive from Korissia.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kea/#otzias-otzias-festival-agia-marina-otzias
